            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. A Temporary Working Leader shall receive the Working Leader premium provided herein from the first day of assignment provided the appointment is for one (1) calendar week or more. However, he or she may be designated to act as Temporary Working Leader for a period not to exceed three (3) weeks at any one time.",
