        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. In the selection of a working leader, the employees with the longest actual service in the Job Classification from which the Working Leader appointment will be made in the Section, then in the Department, shall be given first consideration provided he or she possess the qualifications, ability to lead the group to which he or she may be appointed, physical fitness to perform the duties and satisfactory conduct and attendance records.",
